{"availability":"available","full":"jansmolders86/github-pages-cms","name":"github-pages-cms","description":"A simple CMS for Github Pages","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":57,"forks":10,"created":"2018-02-11T23:25:12Z","updated":"2020-02-16T00:23:30Z","branch":"master","homepage":null,"topics":["cms","content-management","github-pages","json"],"demo":"https://jansmolders86.github.io/github-pages-cms/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T00:56:07.305Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T00:56:07.305Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T00:56:07.305Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T07:22:49.272Z","stars":57,"forks":10},{"at":"2026-10-08T09:24:28.651Z","stars":57,"forks":10},{"at":"2026-10-10T19:01:42.915Z","stars":57,"forks":10},{"at":"2026-10-12T02:04:45.537Z","stars":57,"forks":10},{"at":"2026-10-16T00:56:07.305Z","stars":57,"forks":10}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A Simple Content Management System on Github Pages, for Github Pages.","Every once in a while I get asked to create a small simple low-budget website. The client usually has no clue what it takes to build a website let alone host it. I'm talking about the local butcher wanting a website. They often don't want to pay monthly hosting fees and get scared of the notion of seeing any code. So I wanted to host these sites on Github pages, but there is no way to offer a decent CMS experience. Let alone a CMS hosted on github pages itself. So, eventually this idea for a simple CMS was born using the GitHub API."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jansmolders86/github-pages-cms/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"301c21808328f4113bef33a3a86dcbf1727f4a69a4d5e41af517157a5cc1ac2b","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T07:22:49.450Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:45.661Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A Simple Content Management System on Github Pages, for Github Pages.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jansmolders86/github-pages-cms/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The CMS Login requires you to use a github token instead of a password to add some security.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jansmolders86/github-pages-cms/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The CMS Frontend is rendered on the fly and saving the content is immediate, refresh the page requires a login again.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jansmolders86/github-pages-cms/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"301c21808328f4113bef33a3a86dcbf1727f4a69a4d5e41af517157a5cc1ac2b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jansmolders86/github-pages-cms/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:45.661Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2020-02-16T00:23:30Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jansmolders86/github-pages-cms/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:45.662Z","hash":"301c21808328f4113bef33a3a86dcbf1727f4a69a4d5e41af517157a5cc1ac2b","originalBytes":4350,"storedBytes":4350,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:45.663Z","subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Other","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":[],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://jansmolders86.github.io/github-pages-cms/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-13T20:18:30.917Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T20:18:30.917Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-13T20:18:30.917Z","target":"https://jansmolders86.github.io/github-pages-cms/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-20T20:18:30.917Z"},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T20:18:30.917Z","previewCheck":{"url":"https://jansmolders86.github.io/github-pages-cms/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-13T20:18:30.917Z","consecutiveFailures":0,"status":"capture